WEBVTT

01:26.289 --> 01:29.770
[Glory]

01:30.530 --> 01:32.950
[Episode 30]

01:32.970 --> 01:35.150
[Chongxi Hall]

01:40.000 --> 01:40.800
They're back.

01:43.950 --> 01:45.039
What did the chief managers

01:45.039 --> 01:46.870
and the estates' supervisors say?

01:46.870 --> 01:49.280
They came specially
to offer congratulations.

01:49.280 --> 01:51.280
Unexpectedly, before we could
even start the evening banquet,

01:51.280 --> 01:53.080
such a serious matter occurred.

01:53.509 --> 01:54.570
After this ordeal,

01:54.870 --> 01:56.870
I'm afraid Grandmother
won't be able to manage affairs anymore.

01:56.870 --> 01:57.560
Everyone agreed

01:57.560 --> 01:59.759
to nominate Lady Shanbao
as the head of the family

01:59.759 --> 02:01.070
and follow her lead.

02:01.510 --> 02:03.430
While all the regional managers are here,

02:03.430 --> 02:05.200
tomorrow, the Rong family
will open the ancestral hall

02:05.200 --> 02:07.230
to worship
and inform the ancestors officially.

02:07.230 --> 02:08.150
From now on,

02:08.680 --> 02:09.400
our Rong family

02:09.400 --> 02:10.729
will have a new hostess.

02:12.150 --> 02:14.120
Shanbao, you truly deserve this honor.

02:14.120 --> 02:16.920
Then let me congratulate you first,
Lady Shanbao.

02:17.800 --> 02:18.470
Xiangling.

02:19.280 --> 02:20.079
Tomorrow, I will inform

02:20.079 --> 02:21.480
the Rong family's elders

02:21.560 --> 02:23.329
to officially change your surname
and let you return to our clan

02:23.329 --> 02:26.390
so that you can truly be member
of the Rong family again.

02:26.710 --> 02:27.430
Really?

02:28.680 --> 02:30.410
I knew you wouldn't deceive me.

02:30.630 --> 02:32.190
I'll go back now
to bathe and change clothes

02:32.190 --> 02:33.650
to get prepared properly.

02:37.470 --> 02:38.540
Tomorrow, the Rong family

02:38.540 --> 02:41.030
will still need to
perform an important pilgrimage ceremony.

02:41.030 --> 02:43.190
My dear sisters, go back and rest early.

02:43.190 --> 02:45.120
I'll go inside to see Grandmother.

02:58.560 --> 03:00.220
Old Madam, please drink some.

03:04.800 --> 03:05.600
Lady Shanbao.

03:13.280 --> 03:16.079
Grandmother,
if you refuse to take your medicine,

03:16.690 --> 03:17.970
how will you recover?

03:21.460 --> 03:23.390
Are you still trying to deceive me?

03:24.400 --> 03:25.400
Those people outside

03:25.400 --> 03:26.710
can't wait for me to die soon

03:26.710 --> 03:28.370
so that I can make room for you.

03:28.800 --> 03:31.000
You've suspected Wei Yao for a long time.

03:31.000 --> 03:32.280
Why didn't you

03:32.470 --> 03:34.030
say anything about it to me?

03:34.870 --> 03:36.750
Grandmother, you're getting old now.

03:36.750 --> 03:37.520
I was afraid you couldn't bear to...

03:37.520 --> 03:39.000
I think you just resent me
for being old and stubborn

03:39.000 --> 03:40.400
and showing partiality.

03:44.710 --> 03:47.360
I never thought
that after a lifetime of wisdom,

03:47.360 --> 03:48.320
in my old age,

03:49.360 --> 03:51.620
I would be deceived so thoroughly.

03:52.910 --> 03:54.910
You really have such great patience.

03:54.910 --> 03:56.190
You've been enduring it until today

03:56.190 --> 03:57.390
before exposing him.

03:59.310 --> 04:00.120
You want everyone

04:00.120 --> 04:01.560
to see that

04:02.340 --> 04:03.870
I'm old and muddle-headed,

04:05.120 --> 04:07.320
as I've mistaken thieves for relatives

04:07.360 --> 04:08.870
and let villains come into our home,

04:08.870 --> 04:11.330
and thus,
I can no longer hold this position.

04:11.770 --> 04:13.570
You're trying to seize my power.

04:14.710 --> 04:15.510
Grandmother.

04:16.040 --> 04:16.970
I wouldn't dare.

04:17.120 --> 04:18.180
You wouldn't dare?

04:18.269 --> 04:19.950
I think you're quite bold.

04:24.560 --> 04:26.220
What you've concealed from me

04:26.870 --> 04:28.930
is probably more than just this, huh?

04:31.870 --> 04:32.430
Tell me.

04:33.480 --> 04:35.190
Grandmother, you're wise and insightful,

04:35.190 --> 04:37.250
being as formidable as you used to be.

04:37.510 --> 04:39.170
I do have something to report.

05:23.190 --> 05:24.000
Are you so eager

05:24.000 --> 05:25.660
to show off your victory here?

05:26.040 --> 05:28.770
Throwing cups around,
you have such a bad temper.

05:28.870 --> 05:30.600
In this way, you would fail to live up to

05:30.600 --> 05:32.600
Mr. Bai's pure-hearted affection.

05:34.040 --> 05:35.000
Don't be so smug.

05:35.900 --> 05:36.740
You and Bai Yingsheng

05:36.740 --> 05:37.870
conspired to burn the Tea King Tree.

05:37.870 --> 05:39.580
Let's see if Grandmother will spare you.

05:39.580 --> 05:41.980
Since I've dared to do that,
I'm not afraid.

05:42.780 --> 05:44.340
I've burnt the tree this time

05:44.340 --> 05:45.800
mostly for the Rong family

05:46.120 --> 05:47.720
and partly for you.

05:49.430 --> 05:50.040
For me?

05:50.920 --> 05:52.409
You've been clever since childhood,

05:52.409 --> 05:54.470
but you tend to overthink everything

05:54.600 --> 05:56.860
and have never been sincere with anyone.

05:57.010 --> 05:59.760
One can't write two "Rong" characters
with one stroke.

05:59.760 --> 06:01.090
I want you to understand

06:01.670 --> 06:02.930
all members of a family

06:03.340 --> 06:04.670
share a common destiny.

06:05.890 --> 06:06.470
Although Grandmother wants

06:06.470 --> 06:07.730
us sisters to compete,

06:08.270 --> 06:10.130
with our home burning into ashes,

06:10.480 --> 06:11.680
even if one of us wins,

06:11.870 --> 06:13.730
she would just be a queen of ruins.

06:15.070 --> 06:17.430
Yunshu, first of all, we're family,

06:18.460 --> 06:20.920
and our competitive relation is secondary.

06:30.740 --> 06:31.490
Shanbao.

06:33.100 --> 06:34.159
I'm jealous of you.

06:36.630 --> 06:37.450
I'm jealous because on your birthday,

06:37.450 --> 06:40.810
you could always get a sachet
Grandmother embroidered for you.

06:40.810 --> 06:41.710
I'm jealous because when tasting new tea,

06:41.710 --> 06:43.360
you could always
get served half a cup of it before me.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.690
And I'm even jealous...

06:47.840 --> 06:48.909
And I'm even jealous
because when you stand there,

06:48.909 --> 06:51.510
you would
naturally gain everyone's support.

06:52.570 --> 06:53.700
I've lost this time.

06:56.880 --> 06:58.080
But I won't accept it.

07:00.790 --> 07:02.450
There's still a long way to go.

07:02.550 --> 07:05.480
I'll wait for you to come
and compete with me anytime.

07:06.320 --> 07:07.980
That's what you've promised.

07:14.160 --> 07:14.880
Yunshu.

07:17.080 --> 07:19.010
Do you still remember that saying?

07:20.640 --> 07:22.170
When the storm is coming...

07:23.550 --> 07:25.210
Let's just share an umbrella.

07:25.520 --> 07:27.180
Could you act this out with me?

07:28.410 --> 07:29.520
Shanbao has been suspicious of Yan Bailou

07:29.520 --> 07:30.650
for quite some time.

07:31.590 --> 07:32.720
Actually, that day,

07:32.940 --> 07:33.980
if Yan Bailou...

07:34.990 --> 07:37.350
if Wei Yao had not pretended
to protect her,

07:37.350 --> 07:38.159
Lady Shanbao would have only

07:38.159 --> 07:39.670
suffered some minor injuries.

07:39.670 --> 07:40.720
But in this way,

07:40.960 --> 07:42.220
it made us more certain

07:42.470 --> 07:44.320
that this man had great ambitions,

07:44.320 --> 07:45.720
and we must be wary of him.

07:46.940 --> 07:48.870
You just want to take revenge on me.

07:48.960 --> 07:50.490
You won't let me have my way.

07:51.400 --> 07:52.730
Out! Get out!

07:53.490 --> 07:54.750
I don't want to see you.

07:57.840 --> 07:58.640
Grandmother.

07:59.600 --> 08:00.920
I intend to let Yunshu

08:01.250 --> 08:03.380
manage the branch shop in the capital.

08:03.440 --> 08:04.810
There aren't many days left

08:04.810 --> 08:05.940
when you can see her.

08:09.520 --> 08:11.300
Grandmother, please forgive me.

08:11.300 --> 08:12.570
That day, I actually

08:13.580 --> 08:15.780
thought about switching your medicine

08:16.730 --> 08:18.810
to take revenge for my own mother.

08:23.930 --> 08:24.960
But I hesitated.

08:26.130 --> 08:27.930
I couldn't bring myself to do it.

08:29.030 --> 08:30.350
Shanbao is right.

08:31.010 --> 08:31.810
My father

08:31.810 --> 08:33.740
was a gentle and affectionate man,

08:34.400 --> 08:35.130
but he was not

08:35.130 --> 08:36.880
a qualified member of the Rong family.

08:36.880 --> 08:39.010
A man indulged in personal affections

08:39.360 --> 08:40.720
could never be your son.

08:41.880 --> 08:43.090
He disappointed you.

08:44.800 --> 08:46.010
I am the same.

08:47.010 --> 08:48.670
I'm not a qualified daughter,

08:49.330 --> 08:51.930
being unable to take revenge
for my own mother.

08:51.970 --> 08:52.630
I'm also not

08:52.630 --> 08:54.760
a docile and obedient granddaughter,

08:54.820 --> 08:57.150
being unable to please you, Grandmother.

08:57.610 --> 08:58.680
I respect you,

09:00.250 --> 09:01.580
but I also resent you.

09:07.510 --> 09:09.620
This love and this hatred

09:11.230 --> 09:13.090
have been tormenting me greatly,

09:13.920 --> 09:16.120
so I've chosen to leave the Rong family.

09:16.400 --> 09:19.010
I want to choose a path
where I can put down hatred

09:19.010 --> 09:20.870
and move towards a peaceful life.

09:22.570 --> 09:24.230
As long as you're still alive,

09:25.250 --> 09:27.380
I will never return to the Rong family.

09:29.330 --> 09:32.060
Please take good care of yourself,
Grandmother.

09:33.460 --> 09:35.060
I'm bidding farewell to you.

10:18.400 --> 10:19.880
You were truly reckless.

10:21.850 --> 10:23.780
How dare you burn the Tea King Tree?

10:25.010 --> 10:27.010
Are you trying to destroy the Rong family?

10:27.010 --> 10:29.760
Grandmother,
the Tea King Tree is still there.

11:03.370 --> 11:06.030
Although Yunxi
isn't good at running business,

11:06.090 --> 11:07.280
she has a great gift

11:07.280 --> 11:08.680
for nurturing tea trees.

11:09.520 --> 11:11.010
Any twig she casually breaks off

11:11.010 --> 11:12.210
can survive and grow.

11:12.830 --> 11:13.710
Grandmother, in the past,

11:13.710 --> 11:15.610
you always incited her to compete with me,

11:15.610 --> 11:16.970
but you've never discovered

11:16.970 --> 11:18.210
her true strengths.

11:21.210 --> 11:22.540
You should get out, too.

11:26.490 --> 11:29.350
Grandmother,
you must take your medicine properly

11:29.610 --> 11:30.610
and recover soon.

11:31.210 --> 11:33.330
In the future,
if you want to compete with me,

11:33.330 --> 11:34.280
without good health,

11:34.280 --> 11:35.680
how can you achieve that?

11:36.730 --> 11:38.930
I'll come and greet you again tomorrow.

11:42.010 --> 11:42.920
One day,

11:45.040 --> 11:46.970
you will become the new queen.

11:50.970 --> 11:51.610
Yes.

11:52.760 --> 11:53.280
One day,

11:53.280 --> 11:54.810
I will become the new queen,

11:55.690 --> 11:57.640
a Tea Queen who protects her clansmen

11:57.640 --> 11:59.440
and shelters the common people.

12:04.330 --> 12:05.490
I'm getting old

12:06.280 --> 12:08.680
and don't want to
be angry with you anymore.

12:08.680 --> 12:10.090
When you have time,

12:10.730 --> 12:12.610
don't forget to visit me often.

12:14.160 --> 12:15.130
Tell me

12:16.250 --> 12:18.910
about your future plans
for the tea plantation.

12:19.040 --> 12:19.560
Tell me

12:19.560 --> 12:22.490
about our homeland's sacred mountains
and palaces,

12:22.760 --> 12:24.890
as well as those stories from the past.

12:27.210 --> 12:27.730
I...

12:32.370 --> 12:35.470
I've long failed to
remember them clearly.

12:42.050 --> 12:42.690
Okay.

13:16.090 --> 13:16.760
Have you

13:18.250 --> 13:19.800
betrayed me?

13:20.760 --> 13:21.520
Old Madam.

13:23.450 --> 13:24.130
I will never

13:24.130 --> 13:25.490
betray you.

13:26.400 --> 13:28.330
It's just that I can't interfere, either.

13:28.330 --> 13:30.640
Every generation's head of the Rong family

13:30.640 --> 13:32.440
must go through the same trials,

13:33.400 --> 13:37.400
being isolated from her family
and risking everything for just one goal.

13:37.400 --> 13:37.970
She needs to have

13:37.970 --> 13:39.900
enough perseverance and patience

13:40.640 --> 13:42.570
to overcome this challenge alone.

13:43.330 --> 13:44.660
Even back then, you also

13:44.760 --> 13:46.420
went through the same trials.

13:47.280 --> 13:50.010
The first rule
for the Rong family's daughters is

13:51.280 --> 13:54.800
obeying neither monarchs nor elders,

13:55.520 --> 13:58.290
but following the righteous path
in the mortal world

13:58.290 --> 14:00.550
for the sake of morality and conscience.

14:03.520 --> 14:05.040
She's doing so well.

14:06.560 --> 14:07.450
From now on, just let Lady Shanbao

14:07.450 --> 14:08.850
handle all the problems.

14:13.090 --> 14:14.010
Please sleep.

14:14.370 --> 14:16.170
I will stay here to watch over you

14:16.410 --> 14:17.670
and won't go anywhere.

14:20.400 --> 14:21.730
This girl...

14:44.450 --> 14:45.180
Lady Yunshu.

14:46.410 --> 14:49.070
Mr. Bai, are you here
to collect a debt or kill me?

14:49.680 --> 14:51.280
I'm here to ask for an answer.

14:51.560 --> 14:52.210
Yunshu.

14:52.800 --> 14:54.640
Lady Shanbao has told me everything.

14:54.640 --> 14:56.370
You couldn't bear to see me die.

14:58.230 --> 15:03.060
♪ The moonlight chases its way
up to the mountain peak ♪

15:05.280 --> 15:10.780
♪ I lift my head and see the faint trace
of spring snow on your brow ♪

15:12.640 --> 15:18.040
♪ Years of being buried
in paperwork and official business ♪

15:20.420 --> 15:25.800
♪ Who makes the kite snap its string? ♪

15:21.040 --> 15:21.560
My Lord!

15:23.610 --> 15:24.070
My Lord!

15:25.430 --> 15:25.910
My Lord!

15:26.330 --> 15:27.850
It seems someone has drowned over there.

15:27.510 --> 15:32.960
♪ Fate must intend for us
to be bound together ♪

15:28.250 --> 15:29.050
Take me there.

15:29.640 --> 15:30.210
Let's go.

15:34.540 --> 15:40.130
♪ That's why so many challenges are set ♪

15:37.090 --> 15:38.020
It's just ahead.

15:41.770 --> 15:47.000
♪ I can never get enough of looking ♪

15:43.680 --> 15:44.280
My Lord.

15:44.450 --> 15:46.310
The drowned victim is right here.

15:48.050 --> 15:54.290
♪ At this charming
and enchanting smiling face ♪

15:55.510 --> 16:02.170
♪ I cross mountains and rivers
to rush to your presence ♪

15:56.040 --> 15:57.210
Thank you. Thanks.

16:02.660 --> 16:08.960
♪ We face each other, tears
streaming down, yet unable to speak ♪

16:03.040 --> 16:04.370
She clearly knows everything,

16:04.370 --> 16:06.570
but she's still treating me like a fool.

16:09.910 --> 16:16.060
♪ Afraid that the dream is just a sham,
frightening away the pair of swallows ♪

16:10.450 --> 16:12.310
Do you still have feelings for me?

16:16.760 --> 16:17.920
Mr. Bai, what you should find

16:17.010 --> 16:24.030
♪ Can we, in this lifetime,
share the moon's beauty from afar? ♪

16:18.490 --> 16:19.280
are Butterfly Orchids which are

16:19.280 --> 16:21.130
carefully nurtured in a warm chamber,

16:21.130 --> 16:21.850
instead of wild water weeds

16:21.850 --> 16:23.310
growing in the mud like me.

16:24.490 --> 16:31.560
♪ The myriad stars in the sky
can't fully convey our endless affection ♪

16:29.450 --> 16:30.330
Or perhaps,

16:31.010 --> 16:32.640
you just enjoy watching me
use these hands of mine

16:31.720 --> 16:39.070
♪ The wind wafts
in countless thoughts of longing ♪

16:33.160 --> 16:34.560
to push you into the water

16:34.640 --> 16:35.490
and then pull you back out

16:35.490 --> 16:36.820
with a state of madness.

16:39.110 --> 16:45.440
♪ Love exists among mountains and rivers.
Who says it couldn't be fully achieved? ♪

16:42.450 --> 16:43.180
Lady Yunshu.

16:44.250 --> 16:45.490
Lady Shanbao said you agreed

16:45.490 --> 16:46.760
to manage a shop in the capital.

16:46.320 --> 16:52.940
♪ Every single day with you
feels like our very first encounter ♪

16:47.610 --> 16:49.740
I'll be waiting for you in the capital.

16:52.680 --> 16:53.450
Stop them!

16:53.640 --> 16:56.010
Let us in! Step aside!

16:56.400 --> 16:57.400
Let us in!

16:57.400 --> 16:58.730
-Let us in!
-You can't come in!

16:58.730 --> 17:00.330
You can't come in! Step back!

17:00.680 --> 17:01.700
-You can't come in!
-Step aside!

17:01.700 --> 17:03.630
Let us in!

17:04.730 --> 17:05.210
Let us in!

17:05.210 --> 17:07.069
What's all this commotion about?

17:07.660 --> 17:08.460
Lady Shanbao.

17:08.730 --> 17:09.520
Lord Lu is...

17:09.520 --> 17:11.319
I want to move all my belongings inside.

17:11.319 --> 17:12.119
Just tell him

17:12.690 --> 17:13.839
to stop getting in my way.

17:13.839 --> 17:14.359
You...

17:15.280 --> 17:16.280
You may leave now.

17:17.170 --> 17:18.010
Lady Shanbao, well...

17:18.010 --> 17:19.670
So you're still not giving up?

17:19.839 --> 17:22.099
It has always been none of your business.

17:23.450 --> 17:24.010
Yes.

17:26.440 --> 17:27.170
Let's leave.

17:32.840 --> 17:33.490
Lord Lu.

17:34.560 --> 17:36.420
What exactly are you trying to do?

17:41.450 --> 17:43.650
Of course I'm moving in
to live with you.

17:43.890 --> 17:45.290
Who allows you to move in?

17:47.800 --> 17:49.130
You don't allow it, huh?

17:49.360 --> 17:49.840
Fine.

17:50.560 --> 17:52.730
Then I'll just tell them
to move everything back.

17:52.730 --> 17:54.320
But I must warn you.

17:54.450 --> 17:55.690
I came all this way

17:55.730 --> 17:57.690
with the accompaniment of drums and gongs,
making quite a scene.

17:57.690 --> 17:59.450
Everyone in Linji was watching.

17:59.450 --> 18:00.760
If I move back now,

18:00.890 --> 18:02.750
it will cause another sensation.

18:03.170 --> 18:03.840
Go back!

18:04.080 --> 18:05.170
Move everything back exactly as it was.

18:05.170 --> 18:05.690
Hurry!

18:06.410 --> 18:07.210
What?

18:07.230 --> 18:08.830
Lord Lu is moving back again?

18:09.410 --> 18:10.140
Lu Jianglai.

18:10.650 --> 18:12.250
What tricks are you playing?

18:13.650 --> 18:16.210
Now I'll go to the County Office
to sue you.

18:18.560 --> 18:19.650
What accusation is it?

18:19.650 --> 18:21.010
I'm suing you,
the head of the Rong family,

18:21.010 --> 18:22.930
for breaking promises and abandoning me.

18:22.930 --> 18:24.040
Not only did you cancel our engagement
to marry someone else,

18:24.040 --> 18:25.840
but you also insulted my purity.

18:27.710 --> 18:30.240
I've even prepared
the statement of charges.

18:34.450 --> 18:35.080
Leave now!

18:37.760 --> 18:38.820
Lady Rong Shanbao.

18:39.890 --> 18:40.950
What would you say?

18:42.490 --> 18:43.040
Fine.

18:44.590 --> 18:46.050
Tell your people to leave.

18:46.350 --> 18:48.280
Then we can discuss this properly.

18:51.650 --> 18:52.320
Yeah.

18:52.970 --> 18:54.370
They're really leaving.

18:57.450 --> 18:58.010
Bao.

18:58.800 --> 18:59.890
I'm not a man who you can

18:59.890 --> 19:01.040
easily get rid of.

19:01.560 --> 19:03.020
I have quite many tactics.

19:04.080 --> 19:05.690
Before you make your decision,

19:05.690 --> 19:07.420
you'd better think carefully.

19:07.890 --> 19:08.560
From now on,

19:09.120 --> 19:11.010
will we be inseparable lovers

19:11.280 --> 19:12.810
who love each other deeply,

19:13.040 --> 19:14.730
or will we be enemies who hate

19:14.890 --> 19:16.220
each other to the death?

19:18.170 --> 19:19.830
Which choice would be better?

19:21.080 --> 19:21.560
Lord Lu,

19:21.560 --> 19:23.600
don't you still have a good female junior?

19:23.600 --> 19:25.210
Why do you keep pestering me?

19:27.560 --> 19:28.250
Just now,

19:28.610 --> 19:30.450
I already sent my junior to a new house.

19:30.450 --> 19:32.450
I also explained everything
to her clearly.

19:32.450 --> 19:33.930
If I had been a person who hesitated

19:33.930 --> 19:35.060
and acted cowardly,

19:35.280 --> 19:36.040
I wouldn't have dared to

19:36.040 --> 19:37.450
be against Jiang Yiqian openly,

19:37.450 --> 19:39.780
let alone seeking justice for the people.

19:39.800 --> 19:40.730
If I can't even make decisions

19:40.730 --> 19:41.760
for my own affairs,

19:41.760 --> 19:43.290
what's the point of living?

19:43.890 --> 19:46.090
I, Lu Jianglai, just love Rong Shanbao.

19:46.210 --> 19:46.890
Except her,

19:47.360 --> 19:49.210
I'll never fall in love with anyone else,

19:49.210 --> 19:50.840
even if there might be huge flood
in the future

19:50.840 --> 19:52.570
with countless difficulties.

19:52.980 --> 19:54.910
As long as I hold your hand tightly,

19:55.250 --> 19:56.080
there will be nothing to fear

19:56.080 --> 19:56.970
anymore.

19:58.800 --> 20:00.860
I'm only worried that you don't dare.

20:03.970 --> 20:05.430
What wouldn't I dare to do?

20:17.660 --> 20:19.320
It's good that you've agreed.

20:21.080 --> 20:22.690
Among all those who came to
the Rong Mansion to be candidates,

20:22.690 --> 20:23.840
in terms of literary talent,
martial arts skills,

20:23.840 --> 20:24.760
courage and determination,

20:24.760 --> 20:25.760
which of them can compare with me?

20:25.760 --> 20:27.220
None of them deserves you.

20:27.520 --> 20:29.650
In this world,
no one but I can be the ideal partner

20:29.650 --> 20:31.380
to accompany you in the future.

20:31.490 --> 20:31.970
Yes.

20:32.650 --> 20:34.510
None of them is as scheming as you.

20:34.840 --> 20:36.570
Nor are they as thick-skinned,

20:36.650 --> 20:38.980
cunning, fickle and shameless as you are.

20:39.040 --> 20:40.440
I don't have time for you.

20:43.760 --> 20:44.730
So you've acknowledged that

20:44.730 --> 20:46.390
I'm your legitimate husband?

20:46.890 --> 20:47.450
Alright.

20:47.730 --> 20:49.650
Then I'll move in
to live with you right away.

20:49.650 --> 20:50.650
We still need to

20:50.650 --> 20:51.760
hold our wedding in the ancestral hall

20:51.760 --> 20:52.930
and make vows under the paired pillars.

20:52.930 --> 20:54.860
We can't omit any of these rituals.

21:12.380 --> 21:12.970
Bao!

21:16.290 --> 21:18.950
My Lord,
there are messengers from the capital.

21:19.320 --> 21:20.640
Messengers from the capital?

21:20.640 --> 21:21.650
How are they dressed?

21:21.650 --> 21:23.320
There are two men
who are dressed as merchants

21:23.320 --> 21:25.120
and speak perfect official dialect.

21:25.120 --> 21:26.840
The leader is about 40 years old.

21:26.840 --> 21:29.490
He's pale-faced and beardless
with a sharp voice,

21:29.490 --> 21:31.280
not looking like an ordinary person.

21:31.280 --> 21:32.240
Let's return to the County Office first.

21:32.240 --> 21:32.720
Yes.

21:35.110 --> 21:37.690
[Linji Prefectural Office]

21:55.650 --> 21:57.810
[Rong Mansion]

21:59.280 --> 21:59.800
Due to urgent business,

21:59.800 --> 22:01.210
Lord Lu left for the capital overnight.

22:01.210 --> 22:03.210
He didn't have time
to personally say goodbye to Lady Shanbao.

22:03.210 --> 22:04.080
Please remember to

22:04.080 --> 22:05.400
give this letter to Lady Shanbao.

22:05.400 --> 22:05.840
Yes.

22:13.080 --> 22:13.940
Steward Cheng.

22:14.600 --> 22:15.260
The letter.

22:17.730 --> 22:19.260
Old Madam is being sick now.

22:19.890 --> 22:22.360
Lady Shanbao needs to
focus on taking care of her.

22:22.360 --> 22:25.490
She won't deal with
any trivial matters from outsiders.

22:25.730 --> 22:27.170
Even if there are official documents

22:27.170 --> 22:28.490
sent from the County Office,

22:28.490 --> 22:30.350
they must be reviewed by me first,

22:32.010 --> 22:32.970
not to mention

22:32.970 --> 22:34.690
an unpresentable visitor.

22:35.710 --> 22:36.770
Do you understand?

22:37.280 --> 22:37.810
Yes, I do.

22:44.460 --> 22:46.390
[To Lady Shanbao]

22:47.970 --> 22:48.430
Well...

22:49.250 --> 22:50.890
What if Lady Shanbao blames us for this?

22:50.890 --> 22:51.350
Well...

22:53.800 --> 22:55.260
Since Old Madam fell sick,

22:55.520 --> 22:56.800
all the internal and external
responsibilities

22:56.800 --> 22:59.120
have fallen on Lady Shanbao's shoulders.

22:59.120 --> 23:00.690
At 1 AM, the supervisors from outside

23:00.690 --> 23:02.280
were already waiting for her reply.

23:02.280 --> 23:04.280
Diseased tea appeared after the plantation
was closed and harvest stopped.

23:04.280 --> 23:06.320
She needs to go up the mountains at 3 AM.

23:06.320 --> 23:08.180
She has no time for these matters.

23:08.360 --> 23:10.020
Just focus on your own duties.

23:22.360 --> 23:23.760
♪ Stars and the moon descended ♪

23:24.240 --> 23:29.390
♪ Falling Into the mortal world
to make flowers wither and hearts break ♪

23:29.530 --> 23:31.280
♪ How persistent ♪

23:31.300 --> 23:35.920
♪ How can such a fleeting grace
be forgotten? ♪

23:36.600 --> 23:38.420
♪ Beacon fires rose high ♪

23:38.440 --> 23:44.160
♪ With one more dance,
the music is over and people are gone ♪

23:45.410 --> 23:49.890
♪ We found another crescent moon ♪

24:21.800 --> 24:24.390
[One month later, Rong's Ancestral Temple]

24:28.840 --> 24:30.240
Are you truly determined

24:30.280 --> 24:32.010
to abandon the surname of Shen?

24:33.040 --> 24:34.500
I want to be surnamed Rong.

24:34.520 --> 24:35.320
I also want to follow

24:35.320 --> 24:37.080
the ranking order
based on the sisters' ages.

24:37.080 --> 24:38.480
This is my lifelong wish,

24:38.520 --> 24:40.250
and I will never change my mind.

24:53.970 --> 24:57.010
Tomorrow, ask someone
to prepare the three-livestock offerings.

24:57.010 --> 24:58.760
After you burn incense in front of

24:58.760 --> 25:01.280
our ancestors' memorial tablets
and the dragon-and-phoenix pillars,

25:01.280 --> 25:03.450
then no one in the world will dare to say

25:03.450 --> 25:06.050
you're not a member
of the Rong family anymore.

25:26.080 --> 25:27.560
Speaking of which, this is quite strange.

25:27.560 --> 25:28.690
It seems that Lord Lu

25:28.890 --> 25:29.800
haven't visited us

25:29.800 --> 25:30.760
for some time.

25:32.040 --> 25:34.250
He and I were never
meant to be on the same path.

25:34.250 --> 25:36.170
It's good that he has come to his senses.

25:36.170 --> 25:38.120
It's right that he no longer pesters me.

25:38.120 --> 25:39.710
When he was down and out

25:40.010 --> 25:41.360
and trying to live off the Rong family,

25:41.360 --> 25:43.160
you protected him and loved him.

25:43.660 --> 25:45.560
Now that he has resumed
his official position

25:45.560 --> 25:46.890
and regained his glory,

25:46.890 --> 25:49.320
why do you want to
heartlessly abandon him instead?

25:49.320 --> 25:50.560
I have my own reasons.

25:52.730 --> 25:53.320
My Lady.

25:53.840 --> 25:54.840
Lady Yunshu has sent someone

25:54.840 --> 25:56.370
back here from the capital.

25:56.800 --> 25:57.760
Yunshu

25:58.120 --> 25:59.410
has been in the capital for just two days,

25:59.410 --> 26:01.560
and now she's in such a hurry
to send a message back.

26:01.560 --> 26:02.890
Maybe Mr. Bai

26:03.040 --> 26:05.040
fell in love with someone else
as soon as he entered the capital,

26:05.040 --> 26:07.770
so she's urgently asking you
to set things right.

26:08.210 --> 26:10.010
Mr. Bai wouldn't dare to do that.

26:10.170 --> 26:12.600
Yunshu is not someone
who can be easily pushed around.

26:12.600 --> 26:13.930
Bring the messenger in.

26:13.970 --> 26:14.560
Yes.

26:23.410 --> 26:24.940
She's really so efficient.

26:25.360 --> 26:26.620
The new tea containers for next year

26:26.620 --> 26:27.750
are already ready.

26:30.210 --> 26:31.540
Something's not right.

26:32.040 --> 26:35.170
This pottery is a bit too crude.

26:49.520 --> 26:51.050
This tea aroma is not right.

26:59.600 --> 27:01.800
These are our Rong family's tea leaves.

27:01.800 --> 27:02.840
What's the problem?

27:02.840 --> 27:05.730
The Rong family's tea leaves
have a pure and mellow aroma.

27:05.730 --> 27:06.890
But the tea aroma in this container

27:06.890 --> 27:08.420
is somewhat dull and murky.

27:09.080 --> 27:10.930
The fragrance is also a bit faint.

27:10.930 --> 27:12.600
They don't look like
this year's fresh tea leaves,

27:12.600 --> 27:14.400
but rather like aged tea leaves.

27:14.690 --> 27:15.820
And look here again.

27:16.210 --> 27:17.250
There are even red stems

27:17.250 --> 27:18.760
mixed in the tea leaves.

27:19.210 --> 27:21.410
Either the fresh leaves
were damaged during picking

27:21.410 --> 27:22.450
or the tea-making masters

27:22.450 --> 27:24.210
didn't knead them thoroughly enough.

27:24.210 --> 27:25.560
These leaves are definitely not

27:25.560 --> 27:27.160
from our Rong's Plantation.

27:28.010 --> 27:29.410
What on earth is going on?

27:29.450 --> 27:31.250
Please forgive me, Lady Shanbao.

27:31.250 --> 27:33.010
I really know nothing about this.

27:33.010 --> 27:35.360
If you know nothing,
what message are you delivering?

27:35.360 --> 27:36.120
Someone in the capital

27:36.120 --> 27:37.890
dares to counterfeit
our Rong family's tea leaves.

27:37.890 --> 27:38.450
Why didn't Rong Yunshu

27:38.450 --> 27:40.120
report it to the authorities
for legal action immediately?

27:40.120 --> 27:42.170
How dare she bring this problem here
for Lady Shanbao?

27:42.170 --> 27:43.690
She's so muddle-headed.

27:43.690 --> 27:45.590
How exactly is she managing things?

27:45.590 --> 27:47.450
Did Lady Yunshu ask you
to deliver a message?

27:47.450 --> 27:48.650
Lady Yunshu ordered me

27:48.650 --> 27:49.890
to inform you that

27:50.490 --> 27:52.520
these are the Rong family's tea leaves.

27:52.520 --> 27:54.050
She may have poor eyesight,

27:54.170 --> 27:55.700
but she's not deaf or blind.

27:55.760 --> 27:56.760
In the past, she always boasted about

27:56.760 --> 27:58.090
her keen sense of smell.

27:58.170 --> 27:59.040
How come at this crucial moment,

27:59.040 --> 28:00.440
it doesn't work instead.

28:00.730 --> 28:02.520
If we let such inferior tea leaves go out,

28:02.520 --> 28:04.650
how could the Rong family
keep doing business in the future?

28:04.650 --> 28:05.450
I got it.

28:05.930 --> 28:07.280
You've had a tiring journey.

28:07.280 --> 28:08.280
You may leave now.

28:08.450 --> 28:09.080
Yes.

28:12.690 --> 28:14.560
Someone
is usurping our Rong family's name.

28:14.560 --> 28:16.560
It's better to deal with it quickly.

28:16.650 --> 28:18.930
But Yunshu even asked someone
to send a tea container here,

28:18.930 --> 28:19.760
insisting that

28:19.760 --> 28:21.450
those were our family's tea leaves.

28:21.450 --> 28:22.930
What could be her intention?

28:22.930 --> 28:25.600
Xiu Qiong, invite Lady Yunxi here now.

28:26.170 --> 28:27.770
Tell her I have urgent matters to discuss.

28:27.770 --> 28:28.530
Yes.

28:29.730 --> 28:31.130
What are you trying to do?

28:32.250 --> 28:34.180
Yunshu seems to have said nothing,

28:34.280 --> 28:35.880
but she has said everything.

28:36.010 --> 28:37.250
This person dares to openly do business

28:37.250 --> 28:39.080
in the name of the Rong family
in the capital,

28:39.080 --> 28:39.800
but Yunshu

28:40.360 --> 28:42.360
finds it difficult to deal with him.

28:42.410 --> 28:43.600
Who is this person?

28:45.360 --> 28:46.320
Could it be...

28:47.280 --> 28:48.890
It looks like I need to

28:48.890 --> 28:50.290
go to the capital myself.

28:51.410 --> 28:52.340
I'll go with you.

28:56.650 --> 28:58.450
She still can't let go after all.

28:59.490 --> 29:01.690
It makes me seem shallow in comparison.

29:01.930 --> 29:03.730
What are you talking about, sir?

29:03.800 --> 29:04.690
Lady Shanbao wants you

29:04.690 --> 29:06.210
to accompany her to the capital

29:06.210 --> 29:08.540
to solve the issue of inferior tea leaves.

29:12.250 --> 29:13.040
I will go.

29:17.730 --> 29:18.730
You may leave now.

29:19.970 --> 29:20.410
Yes.

30:20.970 --> 30:22.770
Since she has chosen to go to you,

30:23.600 --> 30:25.330
I will just pave the way for her.

30:27.120 --> 30:27.850
Lu Jianglai.

30:29.320 --> 30:30.250
Don't let the stuff

30:30.250 --> 30:31.650
I've buried underground

30:31.910 --> 30:33.540
be dug out again.

31:17.560 --> 31:18.490
Where are we now?

31:19.450 --> 31:21.110
We've arrived in the capital.

31:24.990 --> 31:27.840
[Capital]

31:38.600 --> 31:39.930
Whose carriage is this?

31:40.210 --> 31:41.760
Such fine horses

31:41.760 --> 31:43.160
and such elegant luxury.

31:43.170 --> 31:44.450
It's even more impressive than the way

31:44.450 --> 31:45.210
an imperial princess travels.

31:45.210 --> 31:45.890
Indeed.

32:00.350 --> 32:02.080
Lady Shanbao, this is the shop.

32:14.240 --> 32:16.170
[Rongzhai]

32:17.800 --> 32:18.520
Miss,

32:18.970 --> 32:20.840
the finest tea leaves in our shop

32:20.840 --> 32:21.890
are all here.

32:22.040 --> 32:23.410
I'm not bragging.

32:23.560 --> 32:26.220
Rongzhai Tea Plantation
is a century-old shop.

32:26.450 --> 32:29.080
These are the best tea leaves
in the world.

32:29.600 --> 32:31.210
Even the aristocrats in the palace

32:31.210 --> 32:33.410
all use tea leaves from the Rong family.

32:33.450 --> 32:34.520
Wherever you go,

32:34.600 --> 32:36.120
when people mention our tea,

32:36.120 --> 32:38.050
they would all give it a thumbs-up.

32:55.080 --> 32:55.760
These are rough tea leaves

32:55.760 --> 32:57.420
from the northern Min Region.

32:57.930 --> 33:00.730
They did put some efforts
into the craftsmanship.

33:02.410 --> 33:03.740
Please look carefully.

33:04.050 --> 33:05.800
These are top-quality Songluo Tea Leaves.

33:05.800 --> 33:07.360
You really don't know
how to tell good from bad.

33:07.360 --> 33:09.080
Rough tea leaves
are such inferior products.

33:09.080 --> 33:10.560
How can you mix them up?

33:38.760 --> 33:40.080
By using rough tea leaves' fresh bud heads

33:40.080 --> 33:41.340
as Songluo Tea Leaves,

33:41.890 --> 33:42.410
you can deceive

33:42.410 --> 33:44.360
non-native merchants
who know little about tea.

33:44.360 --> 33:45.080
This jar

33:45.320 --> 33:47.320
contains tea leaves
from our Rong family indeed.

33:47.320 --> 33:47.890
However, they're not

33:47.890 --> 33:49.730
the fresh tea leaves
that have just been picked this year,

33:49.730 --> 33:51.560
but aged tea leaves from previous years.

33:51.560 --> 33:52.320
To make the tea leaves

33:52.320 --> 33:53.850
look fresher and brighter,

33:54.080 --> 33:57.080
you've dyed them,
added oil and pan-fried them again.

33:58.580 --> 34:00.320
You've even added some iron powder,

34:00.320 --> 34:02.250
making them look fresh green
after the pan-frying.

34:02.250 --> 34:05.050
This is good enough
to fool ordinary restaurants.

34:05.490 --> 34:06.970
In this jar of top-grade tea leaves,

34:06.970 --> 34:08.730
there is the smallest quantity
of aged tea leaves mixed in them.

34:08.730 --> 34:09.480
You were afraid it would be discoverd

34:09.480 --> 34:11.010
by experienced tea customers
who know tea products well,

34:11.010 --> 34:13.940
so you only slightly
fumigated them with fragrance.

34:18.449 --> 34:19.639
You have different tricks

34:19.639 --> 34:21.120
for different tea customers.

34:21.120 --> 34:23.040
So you think
this is a righteous way to make money?

34:23.040 --> 34:24.500
You're talking nonsense!

34:24.560 --> 34:26.020
You're talking nonsense!

34:26.120 --> 34:28.050
You're here to cause trouble, huh?

34:28.080 --> 34:28.679
Guards!

34:29.330 --> 34:30.969
Drive all these troublemakers away

34:30.969 --> 34:31.810
right now!

34:33.449 --> 34:34.000
Wait!

34:34.989 --> 34:36.780
What... What are you all doing?

34:38.290 --> 34:39.550
We're shutting down your shop.

34:39.550 --> 34:40.670
Do you know where you are now?

34:40.670 --> 34:42.150
How dare you be so impudent?

34:42.150 --> 34:43.810
Do you know whose shop this is?

34:43.949 --> 34:44.870
How dare you!

34:45.010 --> 34:46.250
You can't even recognize

34:46.250 --> 34:47.560
the true head of the Rong family.

34:47.560 --> 34:49.820
How dare you use the Rong family's brand?

34:55.530 --> 34:56.989
Take down that signboard.

35:16.820 --> 35:19.160
[Rong Residence]

35:41.520 --> 35:43.200
Shanbao, Xiangling.

35:43.490 --> 35:44.550
Let's talk inside.

35:46.720 --> 35:47.780
What are you doing?

35:48.200 --> 35:49.160
This is the residence
of the Vice Minister of Personnel.

35:49.160 --> 35:51.090
You have no rights to barge in here.

35:51.770 --> 35:52.630
How dare you...

35:53.970 --> 35:54.930
Are you blind?

35:55.130 --> 35:56.550
Don't you even recognize Lady Shanbao?

35:56.550 --> 35:57.110
Get lost!

35:57.850 --> 35:59.600
L-Lady Shanbao?

36:13.450 --> 36:14.560
They said she was Lady Shanbao

36:14.560 --> 36:15.850
from the main family in Linji.

36:15.850 --> 36:16.640
I was merely

36:16.640 --> 36:18.080
following procedures
by asking them some questions.

36:18.080 --> 36:19.140
But unexpectedly,

36:19.160 --> 36:20.120
they immediately gave me

36:20.120 --> 36:21.250
a big slap on my face.

36:21.340 --> 36:22.130
Madam, look.

36:22.160 --> 36:22.930
My face

36:22.930 --> 36:24.890
is all swollen
from that wicked servant's slap.

36:24.890 --> 36:26.040
As the saying goes,

36:26.160 --> 36:28.120
even before beating a dog,
one has to consider who its master is.

36:28.120 --> 36:29.330
My lowly status

36:28.890 --> 36:30.740
[Liu Yishu,
Second Wife of the First Branch]

36:29.330 --> 36:30.930
isn't worth mentioning indeed.

36:30.930 --> 36:32.240
But what about you, Madam?

36:32.240 --> 36:34.200
You are the hostess of this household.

36:34.200 --> 36:35.730
Even out of respect for you,

36:35.810 --> 36:36.890
they shouldn't have behaved

36:36.890 --> 36:38.490
so rudely outside your house.

36:38.490 --> 36:41.080
If this matter spreads out,

36:39.130 --> 36:40.520
[Rong Yunzhen,
Seventh Lady of the Rong Family]

36:41.560 --> 36:43.520
wouldn't it ruin the family's reputation?

36:43.520 --> 36:44.930
Is that woman from Linji

36:45.600 --> 36:46.790
truly so arrogant?

36:47.160 --> 36:49.850
Zhen, she's your eldest sister.

36:50.370 --> 36:51.410
When you see her later,

36:51.410 --> 36:52.640
you must not be disrespectful,

36:52.640 --> 36:54.200
giving her a reason
to find fault with you.

36:54.200 --> 36:55.490
Since ancient times,
there have been hierarchical distinctions

36:55.490 --> 36:56.850
and rules of respect for seniority.

36:56.850 --> 36:58.080
I respect her as my eldest sister,

36:58.080 --> 36:59.540
so I try to be polite to her.

36:59.970 --> 37:01.900
But Mother, you are her stepmother

37:02.010 --> 37:03.070
and her elder, too.

37:03.520 --> 37:05.520
Although she grew up
in the countryside of Linji

37:05.520 --> 37:06.410
and has never been

37:06.410 --> 37:07.340
educated by you,

37:07.560 --> 37:09.520
the hierarchy and seniority
can't be ignored.

37:09.520 --> 37:11.010
We can't let her be disrespectful to you

37:11.010 --> 37:11.870
and offend you.

37:12.520 --> 37:14.490
Throughout the four seasons,
she never sends respectful greetings.

37:14.490 --> 37:16.890
Nor does she
pays respects during festivals.

37:16.890 --> 37:17.680
This is already a serious breach

37:17.680 --> 37:18.520
of etiquette.

37:19.040 --> 37:20.440
Since she has come to the capital,

37:20.440 --> 37:21.240
her first task

37:21.330 --> 37:22.840
should be paying respects to you, Mother.

37:22.840 --> 37:24.640
That is the filial duty of a child.

37:24.640 --> 37:26.640
How dare she barge in
without informing us first?

37:26.640 --> 37:27.970
She's not only ill-bred

37:28.310 --> 37:30.110
but also utterly unscrupulous.

37:30.160 --> 37:31.490
Mother, don't be angry.

37:32.080 --> 37:33.640
I'll question her about this matter.

37:33.640 --> 37:35.160
I'll make sure she's embarrassed

37:35.160 --> 37:36.690
and feels utterly ashamed.

37:37.120 --> 37:38.450
Her mother died early.

37:39.080 --> 37:39.810
I suppose...

37:41.930 --> 37:43.660
her manner is not quite proper,

37:44.010 --> 37:46.670
and she's not well-versed
in social etiquette,

37:46.770 --> 37:49.030
so your father has rarely mentioned her.

37:49.560 --> 37:51.330
Whenever I suggest bringing her here,

37:51.330 --> 37:53.730
he always finds ways
to change the subject.

37:53.890 --> 37:54.560
But, Zhen,

37:55.080 --> 37:57.160
she may not have been
undereducated since childhood.

37:57.160 --> 37:58.620
Don't follow her example.

37:58.640 --> 37:59.850
Have you forgotten the principles

37:59.850 --> 38:00.930
I've taught you?

38:01.640 --> 38:03.900
A woman should be virtuous and taciturn.

38:04.290 --> 38:05.970
You shouldn't have spoken and behaved

38:05.970 --> 38:06.930
so impetuously.

38:07.640 --> 38:08.770
I'm just trying to

38:08.770 --> 38:10.170
stand up for you, Mother.

38:10.290 --> 38:11.950
She's being too overbearing.

38:13.080 --> 38:14.680
I've heard your grandmother

38:14.850 --> 38:16.870
thinks extremely highly of Lady Shanbao.

38:16.870 --> 38:19.490
She has been managing the household
since childhood.

38:19.490 --> 38:21.450
Let's just assume she's not
quite concerned about formalities.

38:21.450 --> 38:23.650
I'll guide her gradually in the future.

38:24.040 --> 38:24.770
But, Zhen,

38:25.120 --> 38:26.160
when you see her later,

38:26.160 --> 38:27.820
you must not be discourteous.

38:27.900 --> 38:29.980
Yes. I'll just listen to you, Mother.

38:35.800 --> 38:36.730
Who are you guys?

38:38.810 --> 38:40.890
Madam Liu, please.

38:41.120 --> 38:41.780
You guys...

39:02.810 --> 39:04.720
You must be the eldest sister, huh?

39:04.720 --> 39:06.770
How dare you remain seated
in front of Mother?

39:06.770 --> 39:08.330
Bow and greet Mother now!

39:16.720 --> 39:17.920
Why are you laughing?

39:18.010 --> 39:19.810
I'm laughing at someone
who can't see clearly.

39:19.810 --> 39:21.240
You don't even know who I am.

39:21.240 --> 39:22.770
Yet you're already
throwing your weight around.

39:22.770 --> 39:23.700
What did you say?

39:23.770 --> 39:26.630
She said you had mistaken her
for the eldest sister.

39:54.710 --> 39:56.560
[Ledger
of Rongzhai's Fujiu Gate Street Branch]

39:58.120 --> 40:00.320
Y-You're deliberately making fun of me

40:00.490 --> 40:02.290
and enjoying my embarrassment.

40:07.680 --> 40:09.410
Are you Shanbao?

40:13.560 --> 40:15.140
Your father treasures you very much.

40:15.140 --> 40:16.600
He always talks about you.

40:17.160 --> 40:18.850
I've long wanted to
bring you here from Linji

40:18.850 --> 40:20.730
so that our family can be reunited.

40:20.730 --> 40:22.490
But it was a pity that Old Madam
couldn't bear to be separated from you.

40:22.490 --> 40:23.720
With all these reasons,

40:23.720 --> 40:25.370
it has been delayed until today.

40:25.370 --> 40:26.970
When your father sees you later,

40:26.970 --> 40:28.160
he'll be overjoyed.

40:39.290 --> 40:41.420
I've prepared the Hongyu Pavilion for you.

40:41.420 --> 40:43.750
It's the most elegant and spacious house.

40:44.720 --> 40:46.520
You can go see it yourself later.

40:46.520 --> 40:47.930
If you need anything,

40:48.160 --> 40:49.330
feel free to tell me.

40:49.770 --> 40:50.370
No rush.

40:51.600 --> 40:53.460
Let's wait until Father returns.

40:55.160 --> 40:56.810
Mother has shown such earnest affection.

40:56.810 --> 40:58.080
Yet you don't express any gratitude.

40:58.080 --> 40:59.080
You're so rude!

41:00.450 --> 41:02.330
Your sister has traveled a long way

41:02.330 --> 41:03.330
and must be tired.

41:11.160 --> 41:11.960
Come quickly!

41:12.810 --> 41:15.340
Go to my room
and fetch the Yuye Changchun Tea.

41:15.680 --> 41:16.480
-Yes.
-Yes.

41:23.050 --> 41:25.050
That tea is also called Harmony Tea,

41:25.520 --> 41:27.850
symbolizing family reunion and harmony.

41:28.450 --> 41:30.180
Today, our family is reunited,

41:30.930 --> 41:33.060
so it's quite suitable for this scene.

41:38.160 --> 41:39.890
I've read the political essay

41:40.450 --> 41:41.650
you wrote yesterday.

41:41.770 --> 41:45.120
Compared with your previous essays,
it shows significant improvement indeed.

41:45.120 --> 41:45.890
But when discussing

41:45.890 --> 41:48.120
the achievements of our dynasty's founder,

41:48.120 --> 41:49.640
one cannot speak freely

41:49.850 --> 41:50.850
without caution.

41:52.600 --> 41:54.080
As a commoner scholar,

41:54.890 --> 41:56.350
you must be extra cautious

41:57.010 --> 41:58.540
and avoid causing trouble.

41:58.640 --> 41:59.640
Do you understand?

41:59.640 --> 42:00.170
Yes, I do.

42:00.600 --> 42:01.370
Old Master!

42:01.810 --> 42:03.290
Old Master! Young Master!

42:03.760 --> 42:05.760
You two are finally back!

42:06.120 --> 42:08.040
Something serious has happened!

42:08.040 --> 42:09.410
Why are you so flustered?

42:09.410 --> 42:10.210
Speak slowly.

42:10.450 --> 42:11.410
Lady Shanbao from the main family in Linji

42:11.410 --> 42:12.680
has arrived here.

42:12.920 --> 42:14.240
She has confined both Madam

42:14.240 --> 42:15.720
and Lady Yunzhen.

42:15.890 --> 42:17.490
She has confined them?
On what grounds can she do that?

42:16.040 --> 42:17.890
[Rong Heting,
the Eldest Son of the Rong Family]

42:18.040 --> 42:19.490
Tell me! Where are they confined?

42:18.660 --> 42:20.890
[Rong Shanhui,
Second Young Master of the Rong Family]

42:20.080 --> 42:21.160
Right in the Flower Hall.

42:21.160 --> 42:22.940
There are also many armed guards.

42:22.940 --> 42:25.140
The servants are too scared to get closer.

42:25.140 --> 42:26.030
Old Master, please

42:26.030 --> 42:27.950
seek justice for us!

42:28.530 --> 42:29.450
How dare they!

42:33.450 --> 42:34.640
Father! Shanhui!

42:34.980 --> 42:36.180
You're finally back!

42:36.410 --> 42:38.560
Mother and I feel so wronged!

42:40.810 --> 42:43.330
Zhen, your father and brother
have just returned.

42:43.330 --> 42:44.390
Don't pester them.

42:45.810 --> 42:49.240
Heting, Lady Shanbao is here.

42:53.200 --> 42:53.770
Father.

43:08.680 --> 43:11.280
Bao, it's been several years
since we last met.

43:11.640 --> 43:13.040
I've noticed your temper

43:13.520 --> 43:15.050
is getting worse and worse.

43:15.160 --> 43:16.410
Before entering the capital,

43:16.410 --> 43:18.240
you didn't even ask someone
to inform us first.

43:18.240 --> 43:21.290
Today, you've also brought
all these people here

43:21.770 --> 43:23.450
to make such a scene at my home.

43:23.970 --> 43:25.040
Do you still

43:25.040 --> 43:26.160
regard me

43:26.890 --> 43:28.160
as your father?

43:34.290 --> 43:36.020
On Cheng'an Gate Outer Street,

43:36.120 --> 43:37.320
Beiyang Gate Street,

43:37.560 --> 43:38.620
Fujiu Gate Street,

43:39.400 --> 43:41.260
and Dongshun House Front Street,

43:41.450 --> 43:43.780
there is a Rongzhai shop at each location.

43:44.850 --> 43:46.110
The best-selling item

43:46.640 --> 43:48.440
is this kind of tea in front of us.

43:49.490 --> 43:52.290
New tea leaves
are mixed with damp aged tea leaves.

43:52.450 --> 43:54.580
Only experts can tell the difference.

43:55.850 --> 43:56.520
Yunshu.

43:57.330 --> 43:59.160
Just in August and September alone,

43:59.160 --> 44:01.330
the four newly opened shops in the capital

44:01.330 --> 44:02.240
sold a total of

44:02.240 --> 44:03.770
3,500 jin of tea leaves.

44:11.720 --> 44:13.920
How have you been managing these shops?

44:14.370 --> 44:16.970
I can't believe
such a major mistake has occurred.

44:16.970 --> 44:18.370
You're ruining our Rong family's

44:18.370 --> 44:19.770
century-old reputation!

44:19.770 --> 44:22.560
Dear, it's all due to my negligence.

44:23.160 --> 44:24.850
I'm a married woman
who always stays home

44:24.850 --> 44:25.980
and rarely goes out.

44:26.920 --> 44:27.990
All business matters

44:27.990 --> 44:29.820
were entrusted to the shop managers.

44:29.820 --> 44:30.570
I didn't expect

44:30.570 --> 44:32.240
they would substitute
inferior products for good ones

44:32.240 --> 44:34.040
and damage the Rong family's reputation.

44:34.040 --> 44:35.890
Thankfully,
Lady Shanbao discovered it right away.

44:35.890 --> 44:37.080
I will certainly investigate this case

44:37.080 --> 44:38.540
and severely punish them.

44:38.720 --> 44:39.520
Lady Shanbao.

44:40.410 --> 44:42.610
As your family, let me be frank with you.

44:42.770 --> 44:44.080
Since ancient times, being an official
has always been difficult,

44:44.080 --> 44:47.240
especially in the capital
where it's even more difficult.

44:47.240 --> 44:49.560
Your father
is an honest and upright official.

44:49.560 --> 44:52.240
He rarely receives guests
or sends invitation letters,

44:52.240 --> 44:53.930
but there are gift exchanges,

44:54.040 --> 44:56.490
seasonal social engagements
and tributes in winter and summer

44:56.490 --> 44:58.150
that are simply unavoidable.

44:58.200 --> 45:00.450
There are so many people
coveting your father's position.

45:00.450 --> 45:02.040
We have no choice but to

45:02.140 --> 45:03.600
run a few shops privately.

45:04.490 --> 45:06.600
Lady Shanbao, please be more understanding

45:06.600 --> 45:08.460
towards your father's hard work.

45:17.810 --> 45:19.640
Mother has always been soft-hearted.

45:19.640 --> 45:21.330
She inevitably neglected things
when supervising the staff,

45:21.330 --> 45:23.770
so those villains with ill intentions
managed to muddle through.

45:23.770 --> 45:25.040
As for all our shortcomings,

45:25.040 --> 45:26.600
we will correct them from now on.

45:26.600 --> 45:28.480
We will never put you
in a difficult position again.

45:28.480 --> 45:29.680
Since we're a family,

45:30.290 --> 45:32.240
let's not
taint Grandmother's ears with this news.

45:32.240 --> 45:33.570
That would only make her

45:33.640 --> 45:35.100
get angry unnecessarily.

45:36.330 --> 45:38.370
Our forebears of every generation
hacked through thorns and brambles,

45:38.370 --> 45:40.040
building the family business
through hardships

45:40.040 --> 45:40.930
and painstakingly running

45:40.930 --> 45:42.930
this 400-year-old tea plantation.

45:43.160 --> 45:44.120
In the past, there were also the cases

45:44.120 --> 45:45.920
of substituting inferior products
for good ones,

45:45.920 --> 45:48.120
which damaged our family's reputation.

45:48.120 --> 45:50.410
Father, do you still remember?

45:53.160 --> 45:55.290
According to the Rong family's rules,

45:56.010 --> 45:58.470
please withdraw from the clan voluntarily.

48:32.280 --> 48:34.750
[Ming Dynasty's Fake Tea Cases]

48:35.120 --> 48:36.670
In this jar of top-grade tea leaves,

48:36.670 --> 48:38.290
there is the smallest quantity
of aged tea leaves mixed in them.

48:38.290 --> 48:39.040
You were afraid it would be discoverd

48:39.040 --> 48:40.640
by experienced tea customers
who know tea products well,

48:40.640 --> 48:43.340
so you only slightly
fumigated them with fragrance.

48:43.340 --> 48:44.740
During the Ming Dynasty,

48:44.940 --> 48:46.400
tea business was booming,

48:47.010 --> 48:49.160
and fake tea also became rampant.

48:49.930 --> 48:50.860
Some tea sellers

48:51.080 --> 48:53.160
would dye ordinary tea leaves

48:53.450 --> 48:55.040
and sell them as Longjing tea.

48:55.040 --> 48:56.370
There were also some tea sellers

48:56.370 --> 48:58.720
who would mix mud and leaves
into tea bricks

48:58.720 --> 49:01.450
to increase weight
and counterfeit tribute tea.

49:01.850 --> 49:02.680
The imperial court set rules

49:02.680 --> 49:04.560
to severely punish this practice.

49:04.560 --> 49:05.970
According to the Great Ming Code,

49:05.970 --> 49:08.200
counterfeiters would receive 90 floggings

49:08.200 --> 49:09.680
and be exiled to finish penal servitude.

49:09.680 --> 49:10.330
They stamped official tea

49:10.330 --> 49:11.790
with special steel seals,

49:11.970 --> 49:14.130
creating anti-counterfeiting trademarks
in ancient times.

49:14.130 --> 49:15.170
Besides that,

49:15.240 --> 49:16.290
the imperial court also introduced

49:16.290 --> 49:18.270
measures like inspections
by imperial tea commissioners

49:18.270 --> 49:19.670
to crack down on fake tea.

49:19.790 --> 49:21.140
In just one year
during the Zhengde Period,

49:19.960 --> 49:25.700
[In the Ming Dynasty, the ones for
cracking down on fake tea mainly included]

49:21.330 --> 49:23.850
over 300,000 jin of fake tea leaves
was confiscated.

49:23.850 --> 49:25.560
These fake tea cases happened frequently

49:25.560 --> 49:26.040
mainly because

49:25.750 --> 49:27.700
[imperial tea commissioners
and the ‌Inspection Office.]

49:26.040 --> 49:28.040
tea taxes were too high at that time,

49:28.300 --> 49:29.490
the official institutions
monopolized the price to keep it low,

49:29.490 --> 49:30.880
and regional price differences were huge,

49:30.880 --> 49:32.680
which were all considered as
the systemic contradictions.

49:32.680 --> 49:33.410
This also reflects

49:33.410 --> 49:35.010
the deep conflict between Ming Dynasty's
monopoly system of tea selling

49:35.010 --> 49:36.970
and the market economy.

49:37.080 --> 49:38.890
It serves as a historical lesson

49:38.890 --> 49:40.370
for modern food safety regulation.
